WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:13.736
The pot crashed to the floor.

2
00:00:13.737 --> 00:00:18.117
Tom fell too.

3
00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.822
"Oops!" Tom cried.

4
00:00:20.823 --> 00:00:23.595
He landed in a puddle of milk.

5
00:00:23.596 --> 00:00:28.198
Someone was laughing.

6
00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:30.777
It was the mouse.

7
00:00:30.778 --> 00:00:35.019
"You're in big trouble!" the mouse said.

8
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:39.374
"The farmer's wife was going to make cheese.

9
00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:43.889
But you spilled all the milk!"

10
00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:47.427
"I will clean it up," Tom said.

11
00:00:47.428 --> 00:00:50.563
"How?" the mouse asked.

12
00:00:50.564 --> 00:00:53.568
Tom stuck out his tongue.

13
00:00:53.569 --> 00:00:57.685
"I will lick up all the milk."

14
00:00:57.686 --> 00:01:00.477
"Ha-ha!" the mouse said.

15
00:01:00.478 --> 00:01:04.672
"That is too much milk for you!"

16
00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:09.394
But Tom was already licking up milk.

17
00:01:09.395 --> 00:01:20.012
"Mmm," Tom said. "This milk is good!"

18
00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:24.608
"I will have some too," the mouse said.

19
00:01:24.609 --> 00:01:30.260
Tom and the mouse drank and drank.

20
00:01:30.261 --> 00:01:42.254
"Ooh," Tom said. "My belly hurts."

21
00:01:42.255 --> 00:01:51.491
But Tom kept drinking and drinking and drinking . . .
